OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredible' island women
OL,4,Acelebrated in exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition is celebrating the
OL,7,Flives and voices of women in the Isles
OL,8,Fof Scilly.
OL,10,FNo Woman is an Island features the
OL,11,Fstories of 60 women, from young women
OL,12,Fto some of archipelago's oldest
OL,13,Fresidents.
OL,15,FIt brings together portraits, quotes,
OL,16,Ffive suitcase installations created by
OL,17,Fisland artists and a 25-minute film
OL,18,Ffeaturing the voices of women who live
OL,19,Fthere. The free exhibition will be on
OL,20,Fdisplay in the Isles of Scilly
OL,21,FSteamship Office in Hugh Town, St
OL,22,FMary's, until summer 2027.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
