OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredible' island women
OL,4,Acelebrated in exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtistic director of Scary Little Girls
OL,7,FRebecca Mordan said: "There are a
OL,8,Fdisproportionate number of incredible
OL,9,Fwomen here - there must be something in
OL,10,Fthe water."
